00000000  all off
00001000  set bit 3 (OR)
10001001  set bits 7 and 0 (OR)
10000001  clear bit 3 (AND with NOT)
10000010  toggle bits 1 and 0 (XOR)
garden light on? yes

10110110  status byte
00001011  shifted right by 4
00000110  low four bits (AND 0x0F)
bits 6..4 as a number: 3
1 shifted left by 20 = 1048576
